# w63top S1: the shared-(4,4) plan. A's driver chain and the right-stack observer (4,3) both watch
# (4,4), so every A pulse comes 2 gt after a right-stack pulse. A2 is a TRIPLE (pull, push, pull),
# A1 and A3 single: the right stack gets runs (1)(3)(1) = 5 pulses, its watcher sees 2+5+2 = 9 (odd).
# Times relative to A1 = z.
design designs/piston-door-3x3/tracks/wire64b/w63/w63-014-bottom.txt
